 *
 * This test ensures the following business rules for PUT /ai_ecommerce/sellerBusinessProfiles/{id}:
 *
 * 1. Only allowed fields may be updated—attempted changes to immutable fields (such as seller_id, deleted_at) must be ignored or blocked.
 * 2. Uniqueness constraints are enforced (e.g., no duplicate business_registration_number allowed).
 * 3. Soft-deleted profiles (with deleted_at set) cannot be updated, must return error.
