 * 4. Create a business profile for Seller B
 * 5. Update Seller A's profile—modify allowed fields (business_name, contact fields, address, etc.), verify success
 * 6. Attempt to update Seller A's profile, changing business_registration_number to that of Seller B—expect conflict (409)
 * 7. Attempt to update immutable field seller_id—should be ignored or rejected, verify no change in seller_id
 * 8. Soft-delete Seller A's business profile directly (simulate deleted_at), then attempt update—expect error (cannot update soft-deleted)
 * 9. Attempt update as unauthorized user—expect forbidden/403
 */
export async function test_api_ai_ecommerce_sellerBusinessProfiles_test_update_seller_business_profile_success_and_business_rules(
