 * 6. Update the existing favorite, changing its favorite_tag_id to favoriteTag2.id via api.functional.ai_ecommerce.favorites.putById.
 * 7. Verify the returned favorite record now has favorite_tag_id set to favoriteTag2.id and all key associations (customer_id, product_id) remain unchanged.
