 * 2. Attempt role update as non-admin (using given connection; assumed to lack admin rights).
 * 3. Attempt role update as unauthenticated (connection with no headers/token).
 * 4. Both attempts must result in appropriate errors (checked via TestValidator.error).
 *
 * Note:
 * - Realistic creation of admin/non-admin users and role assignment is
 *   not feasible with provided SDK; connection role is interpreted by server.
